## Contributions and licensing

Lapan Malaysia is open source under the [MIT License](LICENSE). You are free to use, study, modify and share the original Lapan source, as long as the copyright and license notice are kept.

Lapan will remain open source. Issues, ideas and pull requests are welcome.

- Do not submit API keys, location history, personal travel logs or other sensitive information.
- By submitting a pull request, you agree that your contribution is released under the same license.

The MIT License covers Lapan's original source only. Third-party components, map data and services keep their own licenses and terms.
